      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuliŵicila cile yakwika kwa Ambuje",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acalongo acimjetu pangali ligongo lyakuti namlembele ya ndaŵi jitiyicitendekwa yeleyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanja mwacimsyene mkumanyilila cenene kuti Ambuje taciyika ndaŵi jele mundu jwalijose akakuganicisya kuti tayice, mpela mwakusayicila jwawiyi, msyene nyumba akakuganicisya kuti jwawiyi tayice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 12:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 24:43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2PE.3.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Pet 3:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jele ŵandu tacitiji. “Tuli pamtendele ni pambone,” Pelepo conasiko cicasimana mwacisisimucisya. Ticicasimana mpela mwele yayikusatiji jwamkongwe pakuyiwona yipwetesi pa ndaŵi jakuti aŵelece, nipo soni ngasapakombola kose kuti atile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo jemanja acalongo acimjangu, nganimŵa mcipi kuti lisikulyo limsisimusye mpela jwawiyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paja jemanja wosope mli ŵandu ŵa mwilanguka, ni kuti musi. Uwe yetu nganiyiŵa yacilo kapena yamcipi iyayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ligongo lyakwe sambano tukagona lugono mpela mwakusatendela ŵandu ŵane, nambo tuŵe mesope ni kuligosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cilo ni cele cakasagona ŵandu nipo soni cilo ni cele cakusakolelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo uwe, yetu yili yamusi, tuligoseje. Tuŵe tulituwete cikulupi ni cinonyelo mpela malaja ga cisyano gakucinjilicisya pamtima, nipo cembeceyo cacikulupusyo mpela cisoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.59.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 59:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.6.13+EPH.6.14+EPH.6.15+EPH.6.16+EPH.6.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aef 6:13-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuti Mlungu nganatusagula kuti tusimane ni lutumbilo lwakwe, nambo kuti tupate cikulupusyo mwa Ambuje ŵetu Yesu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Klistu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŵele ŵiŵatuwilile uwe kuti tukaŵe ni umi pampepe ni Jwalakwe, ndaŵi jituli cijumi atamose tuli tuwile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo sambano mlimbisyaneje mtima ni kamucisyana jwine ni mjakwe, mpela mwele mumkutendelamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maloŵe gambesi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tukumŵenda acalongo acimjetu, kuti mwacimbicisyeje ŵele ŵakukamula masengo pasikati penu, ŵele ŵakulongolela ni kumsalila yakwenela kutenda mu ndamo sya ciklistu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwacimbicisyeje mnope ni cinonyelo ligongo lya masengo gawo. Soni mŵeje ŵamtendele pasikati penu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tukumŵenda acalongo acimjetu, kuti mwajamuceje ŵandu ŵangasaka kamula masengo, nipo ŵandu ŵakwasa mtima mwalimbisyeje, mwakamucisyeje ŵandu ŵangali macili nipo soni mtulasyeje mtima ni ŵandu wosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlolecesyeje kuti mundu jwine jwalijose akusawucisya cakusakala kwa mjakwe ligongo lyakuti jwalakwe atesile cakusakala, nambo ndaŵi syosope mlinjeje kwatendela acimjenu yambone ni ŵandu wosope.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mŵe ŵakusangalala ndaŵi syosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpopeleje mwangalecesya ndaŵi syosope, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mumtogoleleje Mlungu muyosope yene. Pakuti yeleyi ni yakusaka Mlungu kuti myitendeje mwa Klistu Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kasimlinga kose kulekasya masengo ga Msimu Ŵaswela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kasimganyosya maloŵe gakulalicidwa mu lina lya Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlinje yindu yosope naga yili yakuwona; nipo myikamulicisyeje masengo yayili yambone ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nipo mŵambaleje cakusakala ca mtundu uliwose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu msyene, jwele jwakusatupa mtendele, ampitikusye mtima kuti mŵe ŵakweŵakwepe. Amsunjeje ŵambumbu mu msimu, mu umi, soni mcilu, kuti cimŵe ŵangali liŵasi pakwisa Ambuje ŵetu Yesu Klistu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe jwele jwamŵilasile jemanja ali jwakulupicika, nipo tacimtendela yosopeyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
